Description: usb: host: add imx21-hcd in Rust
 The same controller as imx21-hcd.c, beside it and off by default, with its state in vectors
 under one lock instead of intrusive lists, and URBs given back once that lock is released.
 The debugfs statistics of imx21-dbg.c aren't ported.
 .
 Unlike C, it enables an ETD's DMA with a write of that ETD's bit alone. Writing a 1 to
 USB_ETDDMAEN toggles a bit, as the stock 2.6.16 driver's mx2otg_set_toggling_bit knows, so
 imx21-hcd.c's read-modify-write turns off the DMA of every other active ETD.
Author: John Merchant <john@johnmerchant.dev>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [AI generated code]
Signed-off-by: John Merchant <john@johnmerchant.dev>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1fN5HecVTggWQg4Zt8Srt
---
